## How to read this report

Missing lines are configuration the Source of Truth says should be present but
which the device does not have. These are the actionable findings.

Extra lines are configuration present on the device but absent from intent.
They are informational by default, because a template rarely models every local
exception. Set `compliance_fail_on_extra_lines: true` in `group_vars/all.yml`
to treat them as failures once the templates are complete enough to justify it.
